1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
Dexter M: Hey, remember when we played Cattin with Bobby last Friday?

2
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:08,650
Milo M: Yeah. He built the longest road and then wouldn't trade me a single sheep. Total tyrant.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,160
Dexter M: Don't you get a feeling... when you watch him play like that?

4
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:17,980
Milo M: Wha... what? What do you mean, a feeling? Like, indigestion?

5
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:30,490
Dexter M: The way he moves the pieces... the way he builds. That long... long road of his.  And the way he whispers, ore for wheat.

6
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:34,900
Milo M: I... guess? He does have really good settlement placement?

7
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:40,300
Dexter M: And when he rolled a seven and moved the robber?  I had to leave the room.

8
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:42,590
Milo M: Dude. We were playing at your house.

9
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:50,240
Dexter M: So... you also find him sexy when he plays Cattin?
